        "pageid": 76516750,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Another Crab's Treasure",
        "extract": "Another Crab's Treasure is a 2024 Soulslike video game developed and published by Aggro Crab for PlayStation 5, Microsoft Windows, Xbox One, Xbox Series X/S, and Nintendo Switch. The player controls a hermit crab named Kril across an interconnected ocean landscape in order to find a treasure and reacquire his shell, while also contending with polluted enemies. Around the world are microplastics and shells, which can be collected and used as currency for a skill tree and a form of defense respectively.\nThe game was received generally positively by critics.\n\n",
